---
source: crates/rdra-ish-emit/src/tla/tests.rs
expression: bundle.cfg
---
\* A Deadlock_<E>_<col>_<s> TLC reports violated is that deadlock: an instance at s,
\* which has a way out, in a state with no move left. A pass does not prove there is
\* none: a cycle anywhere in the column's cone hides it. rdra-ish verify decides.
\* With -continue TLC reports one invariant per state, the first here: rerun
\* without the reported ones until a run reports no new one.
SPECIFICATION Spec
INVARIANT TypeOK
INVARIANT Deadlock_Order_status_pending
INVARIANT Deadlock_Order_status_paid
INVARIANT Deadlock_Order_status_shipped
CHECK_DEADLOCK FALSE
